flowchart TB
    Start[Administrator registers merchant] --> Pending[Pending status]
    Pending --> Review[Review merchant details]
    Review --> Verified[Set verified]
    Review --> Suspended[Set suspended]
    Verified --> Products[Create active products in a category]
    Products --> Checkout[Products eligible for customer checkout]
    Verified --> Suspended
    Suspended --> Verified
    Customer[Register customer and linked login] --> Active[Active customer can place own orders]
    Active --> Disabled[Administrator deactivates login]
